}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T11:51:04Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T11:51:27Z","body":"I noticed when opening in 4.5.2rc a project/scene that was saved with 4.6 stable, \nall the Animations were missing from the project!\n\nNo errors just Animations gone.\n\nIt's possible it's just a matter of backward compat breaking tho,\ncause the entire 4.6 app build seems to work perfectly and nothing seems corrupted on my end..\n\nI use custom built Editor, Templates, Java Plugs and GDExt libs tho..\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3823311856/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3823320707","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115626#issuecomment-3823320707","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115626","id":3823320707,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j4z6D","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T11:52:54Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T11:52:54Z","body":"Sounds unrelated to this, please open a separate issue report","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3823320707/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3830798072","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115626#issuecomment-3830798072","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115626","id":3830798072,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kVVb4","user":{"login":"Thretcha","id":5649250,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NDkyNTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5649250?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thretcha","html_url":"https://github.com/Thretcha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thretcha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thretcha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thretcha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thretcha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thretcha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thretcha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thretcha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thretcha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thretcha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-01T10:07:41Z","updated_at":"2026-02-01T10:07:41Z","body":"Godot v4.6.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7283) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-7600K CPU @ 3.80GHz (4 threads) - 15.93 GiB memory\n\n//I think this is not a linux only bug, as I have a similar issue on windows\n\nI think I got the same bug.\nMy main scene that I built in all the RC and beta builds was corrupted when I tried to start it today.\nAs far as I can tell the scene file has been written in binary instead of the usual text form the other scenes in the same projects have.\nTo me this looks like godot has dumbed the in memory state to file instead of serialising the scene properly during shutdown.\n\nThat being said I had similar issues with Godot itself. Quite commonly I have to reinstall the Godot editor as the exe file is corrupted (wrong file size even, missing substantial part of data).\nDue to this I think that some serialisation logic that is shared all across the Godot codebase is buggy.\n\nI will provide my scene file even though it probably is not that useful. Sadly I had to change the file extension from .tscn to .txt as github wouldn't let me upload a .tscn file. This shouldn't have had any impact on the file, simply change the extension in the file name after downloading.\n\n[demo.txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24991356/demo.txt)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3830798072/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3855294841","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115626#issuecomment-3855294841","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115626","id":3855294841,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7lyyF5","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-05T17:58:55Z","updated_at":"2026-02-05T18:03:25Z","body":"> I noticed when opening in 4.5.2rc a project/scene that was saved with 4.6 stable,\nall the Animations were missing from the project!\nNo errors just Animations gone.\nIt's possible it's just a matter of backward compat breaking tho,\n\nYes, the animation libraries of AnimationPlayer are stored differently in 4.6. The editor auto-updates them to use the new properties, which are incompatible with the previous version.\n\n> That being said I had similar issues with Godot itself. Quite commonly I have to reinstall the Godot editor as the exe file is corrupted (wrong file size even, missing substantial part of data).\n\nGodot does not modify its own executable, so whatever happened to it was some bug (possibly hardware) unrelated to the engine. The same thing might have affected your scene.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3855294841/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]